  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/magic/time/arrows-circling-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You alter your ranged weapon so it produces an endless supply of non-mastercraft ammunition, which seems to leap into your hand when you reach for it.\nOn each of your turns until the creation ends, you can use a bonus action to make two attacks with the ranged weapon used. Each time you make such a ranged attack, your weapon replaces the piece of ammunition you used with a similar piece of non-mastercraft ammunition.\nAny pieces of ammunition created by this creation disintegrate when the creation ends.</p>",
